{"book":"ruth","num":4,"verses":[{"en":"Then went Boaz up to the gate, and sat him down there: and, behold, the kinsman of whom Boaz spake came by; unto whom he said, Ho, such a one! turn aside, sit down here. And he turned aside, and sat down.","n":1,"sm":"Poasa i le faitotoa o le aai, ua nofo ai; faauta i le tagata o lo latou aiga na fai atu ai Poasa, ua alu ane. Ona fai atu lea o ia, Le alii e, ina afe mai ia, ma e nofo ile mea nei; ona afe ane lea o la, ua nofo ai.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Poasa"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"faitotoa"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"aai,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"nofo"},{"en":"","sm":"ai;"},{"en":"","sm":"faauta"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"lo"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"aiga"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"Poasa,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"alu"},{"en":"","sm":"ane."},{"en":"","sm":"Ona"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ia,"},{"en":"","sm":"Le"},{"en":"","sm":"alii"},{"en":"","sm":"e,"},{"en":"","sm":"ina"},{"en":"","sm":"afe"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ia,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"nofo"},{"en":"","sm":"ile"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"nei;"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"afe"},{"en":"","sm":"ane"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"la,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"nofo"},{"en":"","sm":"ai."}]},{"en":"And he took ten men of the elders of the city, and said, Sit ye down here. And they sat down.","n":2,"sm":"Ua aami e ia toeaina o le aai e toasefulu, ua fai atu i ai, Ina nonofo ia outou i le mea nei; ona latou nonofo ai lea.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"aami"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"toeaina"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},